  "title": "Stuffed Turkey Legs",
  "description": "This recipe is for delicious Puerto Rican-style stuffed turkey legs. My dad's favorite, this is in his loving memory.",
  "authors": [
    "Zulma Lozano"
  ],
  "date_published": "2008-06-30T19:10:59-04:00",
